        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur CIRBOU, Bouton Knob with Circulaire Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Bouton Knob with Circulaire Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. This standard door knob would be a great addition to traditional decor. It is beautiful and has an element of design that complements classically styled homes. The Circulaire Rosette with Bouton Knob comes in several popular finish colors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLove this knob but want a different rose? <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> and we can help you design a Grandeur Door Knobset that is unique!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur CIRBOU Circulaire Rosette with Bouton Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Traditional Bouton Knob with Circulaire Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.15\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-CIRBOU-specifications.pdf?v=1704262389\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur CIRBOU Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Surfaced mounted, non-working, knobs. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
