                "description": "The Bouton Knob with Circulaire Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. This standard door knob would be a great addition to traditional decor. It is beautiful and has an element of design that complements classically styled homes. The Circulaire Rosette with Bouton Knob comes in several popular finish colors.",
